/ccecbcc8246887635047bb7d89943ffb.webm?t=1754999781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003300/extras/ccecbcc8246887635047bb7d89943ffb.mp4?t=1754999781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story Quests</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An immersive gaming experience that lets you delve deeper into your desktop elf world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003300/extras/90a11f3f3dc5b71a894e205734dde7af.poster.avif?t=1754999781\" width=800 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003300/extras/90a11f3f3dc5b71a894e205734dde7af.webm?t=1754999781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003300/extras/90a11f3f3dc5b71a894e205734dde7af.mp4?t=1754999781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Creative Workshop Support</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freely upload/download Mods to enrich your gameplay~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Workshop supports adding/modifying:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character models</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Costume textures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dialogues, voice lines &amp; animations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AI Chat</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3003300/extras/872b448cdd6494720f298566305f2cae.avif?t=1754999781\" data-has-big width=800 height=454 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/app